      <bioghist encodinganalog="545">
         <head>Biographical/Historical Information</head>
         <p>The Board for Contractors was established in 1938 to regulate and license businesses that construct or improve facilities on property owned by others. The Dept. of Professional and Occupation Regulation provides administrative support to the Board.</p>
      </bioghist>
      <odd encodinganalog="500">
         <p>These records are part of the Virginia Dept. of Professional and Occupational Regulation record group (RG 17)</p>
      </odd>
