      <scopecontent encodinganalog="520$a">
         <p>Minutes, agendas and related attachments documenting the activities of the Board for Contractors for the years 1938-1986 and 1994-2010. May also include minutes of informal fact finding conferences related to citizen complaints and conflict of interest letters.</p>
      </scopecontent>





